notebooks/*.nbconvert.ipynb

# NOTE on data/:
# Raw inputs (data/raw/) and the reproducible derived artifacts
# (data/interim, data/processed, data/results) are intentionally TRACKED so the
# manuscript reference outputs stay version-controlled. Every file under
# data/processed and data/results can be regenerated byte-for-byte by running
#   python scripts/run_full_pipeline.py
